## Baseline interpretation

This repository does not reopen any closed row. A local witness here can show
that an alternative upstream language is mathematically viable or that a map
loses information. It cannot establish that nature selects that alternative.

## Refresh policy

The baseline changes only through a dedicated baseline-refresh commit after:

- the Kernel model changes;
- the relevant source repository result is committed and promoted;
- the dependency is recorded by hash; and
- every existing local certificate still verifies.
